Why NFA First?

Regular Expression → easy to convert into NFA
NFA → converted into DFA
DFA → used in actual scanner because it is faster

Regular Expression
        │
        ▼
       NFA
        │
        ▼
       DFA
        │
        ▼
   Token Recognition


Identifier Regex

[a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9]*

        │
        ▼
       NFA
        │
        ▼
       DFA



NFA Processing
abc123


nfa:
      a-z
  q0 -----> q1

      a-z,0-9
  q1 -----> q1

At one state NFA can:

State q0
   ├── Path 1
   ├── Path 2
   └── Path 3


DFA Processing
Same regex after conversion:

        a-z
 q0 ----------> q1

       a-z,0-9
 q1 ----------> q1


Only one path.

Current State
      │
      ▼
      q1


