Components of Grammar
1. Non-Terminals
Variables that can be expanded. - E, T, F
2. Terminals
Actual symbols/tokens. - +, *, id, (, )
3. Production Rules
Rules for replacement. 
E → E + T
E → T

4. Start Symbol 
Where parsing begins. -> E
